<text pos="62 66" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$s = 0.119$ m \quad every primitive is an arc of this length, walked in $n = 4$ steps of $\Delta s = s/n$</text>
<text pos="62 49" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$\Delta x, \Delta y, \Delta\theta$ \quad what one steering level moves the car, in the car's own frame</text>
<text pos="62 32" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">at a pose $(x,y,\theta)$: rotate $(\Delta x, \Delta y)$ by $\theta$, add $(x,y)$, and add $\Delta\theta$ to $\theta$</text>
